│ Reasoning:                                                         │
│                                                                    │
│ The napoleon extension handles the parsing of docstrings and the   │
│ generation of cross-references. The google_class_prefixes,         │
│ google_type_prefixes, and google_member_prefix settings control    │
│ how Sphinx resolves cross-references based on the module prefixes. │
│ By adding submod to the list of prefixes, we instruct Sphinx to    │
│ prioritize the mod.submod.A module when resolving references to    │
│ 'A' within the mod.submod context.  This ensures that the correct  │
│ module is used for cross-referencing.                              │
